{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:07 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:07 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:07 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8c85bb3a66176f0eb7532dcaa933cb8/2026-11/009_0.png\"/><p>長沙灣發生交通意外。今日（4日）晚上近10時，一輛私家車駛至東京街及元州街交界時，與另一輛私家車發生相撞。據了解，其中一名男司機報稱受輕傷，一度被困，及後已安全逃出車廂。警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"兩輛私家車於東京街及元州街交界發生相撞。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3a253b7d7c502994b215cbd053edfc3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_22_32_32.jpeg\" title=\"兩輛私家車於東京街及元州街交界發生相撞。曾志恒攝\"/><p>兩輛私家車於東京街及元州街交界發生相撞。曾志恒攝</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.021444+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:07:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:40.548610+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:31.450189+00:00","content_hash":"e684b34bfafe089926eeb29348c7a208b8692f2ace54dccfed62a6e830a43e77","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}